Active Trade Manager
  |
  +-- monitor every open ticket one-by-one
  +-- update virtual SL / virtual TP / virtual trailing stop
  +-- close ticket if virtual trigger is hit
  +-- sync active state to Supabase
  |
  v
RiskManager.can_trade()
  |
  +-- blocked / cooling-off / max trade / bad volatility
  |       |
  |       v
  |   SKIP
  |   AI API NOT CALLED
  |
  v
Call MAIN cloud AI
  |
  v
Wait until full response OR timeout
  |
  v
Validate JSON signal
  |
  +-- HOLD / low confidence / invalid
  |       |
  |       v
  |   SKIP
  |   Risk AI NOT CALLED
  |
  v
Calculate lot + virtual SL/TP plan
  |
  v
If ENABLE_RISK_REVIEW=True
  |
  v
Call RISK cloud AI
  |
  v
Wait until full response OR timeout
  |
  +-- rejected / timeout / invalid JSON
  |       |
  |       v
  |   SKIP trade
  |
  v
Place order in MT5
  |
  v
Save virtual exit plan into trade memory + Supabase
  |
  v
Save pattern usage snapshot into trade memory + Supabase
  |
  v
Log trade
  |
  v
