## 4. Active Trade Management: Full Control Per Ticket

Requirement baru:
- Jika ada 4 trade sedang berjalan, bot perlu jaga keempat-empat trade itu satu-persatu.
- Setiap ticket ada state sendiri.
- Bot tidak boleh cuma buka trade kemudian tinggal dengan fixed SL/TP.
- Bot mesti control trade sampai closed.

Flow:
```text
ACTIVE TRADE MANAGER
  |
  v
Get all open positions from MT5
  |
  v
For each ticket individually
  |
  +-- Ticket 1001: check entry, floating P/L, drawdown, thesis, pattern, trend
  +-- Ticket 1002: check entry, floating P/L, drawdown, thesis, pattern, trend
  +-- Ticket 1003: check entry, floating P/L, drawdown, thesis, pattern, trend
  +-- Ticket 1004: check entry, floating P/L, drawdown, thesis, pattern, trend
  |
  v
Decision per ticket
  |
  +-- HOLD: thesis still valid
  +-- PROTECT: update hidden profit-lock level
  +-- TRAIL: update hidden dynamic trailing level
  +-- TAKE PROFIT: close ticket when virtual TP condition is hit
  +-- CUT LOSS: close ticket when virtual SL condition is hit
  +-- EXIT: close ticket when thesis is invalid
  |
  v
Send MT5 close order only when trigger is hit
  |
  v
Save new state to local trade_memory + Supabase
```

Trade state per ticket:
```text
ticket
symbol
direction
entry_price
lot
opened_at
primary_pattern
pattern_names
pattern_categories
pattern_timeframes
confluence_combo
pattern_confidence
pattern_count
original_thesis
current_status
virtual_sl
virtual_tp
virtual_trailing_stop
profit_lock_level
max_favorable_price
max_drawdown
last_ai_management_decision
last_checked_at
```

Important:
- Virtual SL/TP/trailing stop hanya disimpan dalam bot memory/Supabase.
- Ia tidak diletakkan sebagai SL/TP dalam MT5.
- Jika laptop/internet/MT5/API mati, virtual trigger tidak boleh execute.
- Oleh itu perlu fallback monitoring dan manual mode.

