## 9. Model Strategy

Kita jangan pilih final model ID dalam code sebelum test latency/cost.

Cadangan role:
```text
MAIN AI
- cepat
- JSON stabil
- bagus baca pattern + market context
- tugas: BUY / SELL / HOLD

RISK AI
- lebih reasoning
- hanya dipanggil jika signal valid
- tugas: approve / reject trade
```

Model selection rule:
- Pilih model yang support chat completion.
- Pilih model yang stabil output JSON.
- Elakkan model terlalu lambat untuk M5/M15.
- Test 20-50 sample prompts dulu sebelum live.

OpenRouter candidate:
```text
AI_MAIN_MODEL = model Qwen/DeepSeek/GPT mini yang laju
AI_RISK_MODEL = model reasoning yang lebih kuat
```

Hugging Face candidate:
```text
AI_MAIN_MODEL = instruct/chat model melalui Inference Providers
AI_RISK_MODEL = model reasoning/instruct yang support chat completion
```

Nota:
- Exact model ID perlu disahkan semasa implement sebab model catalog boleh berubah.

