## 11. Single AI Lock

Kekalkan global AI lock.

Tujuan:
- Qwen/OpenRouter main AI tidak overlap dengan risk AI.
- Kalau request pertama belum siap, request kedua wajib tunggu.
- Elak race condition bila multi-symbol loop berkembang nanti.

Pseudo-flow:
```python
with AI_CALL_LOCK:
    response = provider.chat_completion(...)
    return response
```

