- Update `.env.example`.

Phase 3: Provider client
- Add `ai_clients/`.
- Implement OpenRouter first.
- Implement Hugging Face second/fallback.

Phase 4: Refactor `ai_engine.py`
- Keep prompt builder.
- Replace `query_ollama()` with `query_ai_provider()`.
- Keep JSON validation.
- Keep single AI lock.

Phase 5: Launcher cleanup
- Remove Ollama startup logic.
- `start_bot.bat` only checks Python, `.env`, API key, then starts bot + dashboard.

Phase 6: Active trade management
- Add virtual exit engine.
- Add active trade manager per ticket.
- Stop sending fixed SL/TP to MT5 unless fail-safe mode is enabled.
- Add close-ticket trigger logic.
- Add trade state persistence.

Phase 7: Supabase + Vercel
- Add Supabase sync.
- Add heartbeat.
- Add active trades snapshot.
- Add pattern usage tracker.
- Add realtime pattern usage dashboard widgets.
- Add trade timeline showing each ticket and pattern used.
- Build Vercel dashboard/manual fallback page.

Phase 8: Testing
- Unit test JSON parser.
- Dry-run AI calls with fake MT5 data.
- Check risk review flow.
- Confirm no trade if AI timeout/invalid JSON.
- Test virtual SL hit.
- Test virtual TP hit.
- Test virtual trailing stop hit.
- Test pattern usage saved when trade opens.
- Test pattern stats update when trade closes.
- Test dashboard table shows trade time + ticket + primary pattern.
- Test laptop offline manual fallback scenario.

Phase 8B: One-year backtest duplicate protection
- Semua file testing setahun disimpan dalam `TESTING DATA SETAHUN/`.
- `TESTING DATA SETAHUN/run_yearly_backtest.py` mesti guna lock file `TESTING DATA SETAHUN/storage/backtests/yearly_backtest.lock`.
- Jika user tertekan `TESTING DATA SETAHUN/run_yearly_backtest.bat` 2-3 kali, hanya proses pertama berjalan.
- Proses kedua mesti stop dengan mesej `Yearly backtest already running`.
- Backtest CSV/report ditulis secara replace, bukan append, supaya result tidak duplicate.
- Jika laptop crash dan lock tertinggal, boleh run `cd "TESTING DATA SETAHUN"` kemudian `python run_yearly_backtest.py --force-unlock`.

Phase 8C: Backtest date memory / no repeat yearly test
- First run ikut tarikh user tekan:
  - contoh run pada `2026-05-25`
  - window = `2025-05-25` sampai `2026-05-25`
- Selepas full-year baseline siap, sistem simpan `TESTING DATA SETAHUN/storage/backtests/yearly_backtest_state.json`.
- Sistem juga boleh baca live/realtime coverage melalui `TESTING DATA SETAHUN/storage/live/live_data_state.json`.
- Jika user tekan lagi pada `2026-05-30` dan live bot memang running 24 jam:
  - live data sudah cover gap selepas `2026-05-25`
  - result = `0 hari historical backtest`
  - tiada duplicate yearly test
- Jika user lama tidak buka laptop/bot dan live data tidak cover gap:
  - sistem auto sambung dari tarikh last tested/live data
  - contoh: last tested `2026-05-25`, tekan semula `2026-06-20`
  - window = `2026-05-25` sampai `2026-06-20`
  - bukan ulang `2025-06-20` sampai `2026-06-20`
- Default auto-gap bermula bila gap melebihi `BACKTEST_AUTO_GAP_AFTER_DAYS=1`.
- Jika user memang mahu historical gap dari last run ke hari ini, guna:
  - `cd "TESTING DATA SETAHUN"`
  - `python run_yearly_backtest.py --include-gap`
- Jika user mahu paksa full year semula, guna:
  - `python run_yearly_backtest.py --full-year`
- Jika user mahu skip gap walaupun lama tidak buka, guna:
  - `python run_yearly_backtest.py --skip-gap`
- Default `TESTING DATA SETAHUN/run_yearly_backtest.bat` tetap selamat: tidak duplicate, tidak ulang yearly baseline tanpa sengaja.

Phase 9: 24-hour laptop run
- Disable Windows sleep.
- Keep laptop plugged in.
- Run bot 24 hours on demo/small lot.
- Monitor Supabase/Vercel heartbeat.
- Monitor manual fallback accuracy.

